    <tr><td>Humidity-resistant and long-lasting performance variants</td></tr>
    </table>
    </div>

    <h2 id="color-sprays">Temporary Hair Color Spray Aerosols</h2>
    <p>Temporary hair color sprays provide instant cosmetic coverage without chemical dye reactions. These systems deposit color pigments or lakes onto the hair surface, enabling quick shade changes, grey coverage, or fashion styling effects that wash out easily. Temporary hair colour formulations are purely surface-based and non-oxidative in nature.</p>
    <p>Aerosol delivery is critical for uniform pigment distribution, controlled color intensity, and reduced patchiness. The formulation ecosystem must ensure pigment stability, suspension uniformity, and non-clogging valve performance under pressure.</p>

