    <h3>Propellants and Spray Physics in Hair Aerosols</h3>
    <p>Propellants provide the driving force that enables atomization and delivery of hair aerosol products. Different propellant systems produce different spray characteristics, influencing droplet size, spray angle, wetness, and deposition efficiency.</p>
    <p>Spray physics directly impacts consumer perception, performance consistency, and product safety. Propellant choice is therefore a technical and regulatory decision rather than a marketing one.</p>

